<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; color: #33503F">Lorem ipsum, <em style="font-style: italic">step by step</em></h2>
</div>
<div style="position: relative">
<svg viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 2px; width: 100%; height: 60px"><path d="M60,30 C200,0 330,60 460,30 S730,0 860,30 S1060,60 1140,30" fill="none" stroke="#C4A98C" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="2 8" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
<ol style="position: relative; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 32px">
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 12px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F6F3EC; border: 2px solid #D9C3AA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 24px; color: #7A5C46">1</span><span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #33503F">Lorem ipsum</span><span style="color: #4F3B2C; font-size: 16px">Consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 12px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F6F3EC; border: 2px solid #D9C3AA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 24px; color: #7A5C46">2</span><span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #33503F">Dolor sit amet</span><span style="color: #4F3B2C; font-size: 16px">Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 12px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F6F3EC; border: 2px solid #D9C3AA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 24px; color: #7A5C46">3</span><span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #33503F">Consectetur</span><span style="color: #4F3B2C; font-size: 16px">Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 12px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F6F3EC; border: 2px solid #D9C3AA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 24px; color: #7A5C46">4</span><span style="font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #33503F">Adipiscing elit</span><span style="color: #4F3B2C; font-size: 16px">Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa.</span></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; background: #F6F3EC; border-radius: 28px; padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start">
<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#7A5C46" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 28px; margin-top: 2px"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10"></circle><path d="M14 13v6M14 9v.5"></path></svg>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #4A463E; font-size: 16px">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet: sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem. Nemo enim ipsam voluptatem quia voluptas sit aspernatur.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<Wave from="#EFE4D6" to="#2F4A3A" shape="rise" opacity={0.35} />
<section style="background: #2F4A3A">
<div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; text-align: center">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; color: #F6F3EC">Lorem ipsum dolor <em style="font-style: italic; color: #D9C3AA">sit amet?</em></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #CFDCC6; font-size: 18px">Quis autem vel eum iure reprehenderit qui in ea voluptate velit esse quam nihil molestiae consequatur.</p>
<a href={site.goRendezVousUrl} data-book-now style="margin-top: 8px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E1EAD9; color: #2F4A3A; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600">{t('seeAvailabilities')} <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2F4A3A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
</div>
